"Indicates whether this RFID event was processed as attendance check-in or "
"check-out.\n"
"\n"
"• Check In: Employee entered an attendance zone\n"
"• Check Out: Employee left an attendance zone  \n"
"• No Info: Event not processed for attendance (may be non-attendance zone or "
"error)\n"
"\n"
"This field is automatically set when recalculating attendance from RFID "
"events."
